      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "0Do1PN94MiEgko-KtHwNm",
      "originalText": "The phone\nEvery screen reads a database on the phone. A save also joins the outbox: a queue of changes waiting for signal.",
